<section class="story shell"><div class="story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">WHY SUNRISE</span><h2>The comfort of a local deli, refined into a brand people remember.</h2><p>Sunrise Bagels & Deli is positioned around quality, speed, consistency and hospitality. The concept brings together fresh bagels, customizable breakfast, classic deli sandwiches, hot heroes, wraps, salads and catering in one welcoming Florida destination.</p><p>The visual identity draws from the name itself: deep black for confidence, warm sunrise gold for energy, and bright cream for a clean, premium restaurant feel.</p></div><div class="story-quote"><span>“</span><h3>Fresh-baked sunshine. New York bagel soul.</h3><p>That is the experience the brand is designed to communicate across every screen and every visit.</p></div></section>
<section class="values"><div class="shell value-grid"><article><b>01</b><h3>Freshness</h3><p>Bagels, breakfast and deli favorites positioned around fresh preparation and made-to-order service.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3>Consistency</h3><p>A franchise-caliber visual system that makes the brand feel established from day one.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3>Convenience</h3><p>Online ordering, catering, AI menu help, responsive design and easy owner updates.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h3>Community</h3><p>A neighborhood-first tone with room to grow into additional locations over time.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="story-photo shell"><img src="assets/images/storefront.png" alt="Sunrise Bagels & Deli storefront"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>From storefront to destination.</h2><p>The website is intentionally structured so the owner can change core content without editing PHP: menu items, prices, hours, promotional banners and key links all live in editable data files surfaced through the Owner Dashboard.</p></div></section>
